Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.90,0:00:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.82,0:01:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so let me bring you up to speed me and\Nthe other six kids were kicking back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.32,0:01:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at summer camp when a freak snowstorm\Nhits we find these digivices and bam the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next thing you know we're transported\Nto this whacked out island one by one we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.86,0:01:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,make friends with these creatures who\Nare known as digital monsters or Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.52,0:01:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything was cool till\NKuwagamon showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.52,0:02:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our new friends somehow Digivolved\Ninto bigger Digimon and scared him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.48,0:02:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or so we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.64,0:02:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about your cliffhangers.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.49,0:02:14.96,Sign,Sign,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Explosive Evolution! Greymon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.60,0:02:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wakuretshinkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.04,0:02:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.00,0:02:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.32,0:02:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.08,0:02:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.92,0:02:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fisting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.78,0:02:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is some ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.46,0:02:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Hey, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew we'd be okay. I wasn't worried.\NWhat was that, a floating fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.28,0:03:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,market lucky for us those fish were\Nhaving a school reunion i'm kidding
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.56,0:03:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those fish are good friends of mine\Nand i just asked them for a lift
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.62,0:03:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and all these years i thought i was\Nallergic to seafood thank you Um,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.42,0:03:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's not Bukamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.42,0:03:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gomamon, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gomamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.26,0:03:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I guess that you're\Nnot Tokomon, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.46,0:03:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm Patamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.68,0:04:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all because we Digivolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.96,0:04:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think that\Nword's in my dictionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.48,0:04:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Digivolving is what\Nhappens when they advance to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.96,0:04:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the next level and become\Nmore powerful than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.76,0:04:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.67,0:04:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of us Digivolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.66,0:04:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went from Motimon to Tentomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I Digivolved from Yokomon to Biyomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.42,0:04:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First I was Tsunomon,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.86,0:04:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then Gabumon. And I changed\Nfrom Tanemon to Palmon. And me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.76,0:04:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was Koromon. I Digivolved into Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.18,0:04:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you Digivolved,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.76,0:04:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you certainly got way bigger Does this\Nmean you're something different now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.34,0:04:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or are you still Digimon? Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.66,0:04:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I needed your help, Tai Me? For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.08,0:04:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, Digivolving is\Na very difficult process
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to be successful,\NI had to share your energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.40,0:04:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.62,0:04:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you guys don't run on batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.46,0:04:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.48,0:04:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how do you access my energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even we don't know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:04:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for my magical powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.50,0:05:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole thing makes my head Spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I help you change.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.22,0:05:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep. Sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My folks warn me about strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.74,0:05:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a stranger, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.30,0:05:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm your friend for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay come on what are we gonna\Ndo if only there was a payphone
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nearby we could call the police or\Nfire department or my mother but we
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.48,0:05:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't even know where we are but we\Nknow where we started up there on
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.52,0:05:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that mountain i say we forget about\Ngoing back and explore around here
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.16,0:05:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm not exploring anywhere i say we\Nstay right where we are yeah let's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.36,0:05:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wait for that giant bug to come get\Nus we need to find a road leading
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someplace to get away from here.\NMatt's right, but without a compass we
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.76,0:05:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't even know which way is north\Nwait i do well which way is it it's the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.24,0:05:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,opposite of south i shouldn't wear\Nthese pants they ride up when i do
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.48,0:05:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a lot of walking you know if we could\Nget back to where we were before
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.00,0:05:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we might at least find some clues\Nas to why we're here in this place
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.24,0:06:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wait are there more monsters around\Nlike that big flying beetle yes indeed
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.78,0:06:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those monsters don't\Nscare me are there humans
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.18,0:06:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,humans others like you\Nyou're the first ever
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.66,0:06:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's never been anything but Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.88,0:06:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, okay, you're all Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.52,0:06:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about these monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.44,0:06:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all Digimon, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.44,0:06:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's creepy and dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.66,0:06:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what happens when it gets dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who says it ever gets dark here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.06,0:06:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That phenomenon would be unnatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.60,0:06:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you call this natural?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.42,0:06:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we're not going to find out\Nanything by sitting around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.70,0:06:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.08,0:06:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up on that cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.32,0:06:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where I saw the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.12,0:06:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, there might be a boat or something
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's water ski home. Oh,\Nfunny. At a time like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it would be far better\Noff just to find a cave and hide
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.26,0:06:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We keep our eyes open and when\Na camp counselor comes Hey Joe,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.86,0:06:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone's leaving us Wait for me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.88,0:07:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These trees are beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.99,0:07:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're really different\Nand I just thought they were
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.66,0:07:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Subtropical? Whatever they are,\Nthey're aggravating my hay fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.10,0:07:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joe, is there anything\Nyou don't complain about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.28,0:07:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.52,0:07:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly who came up with that name anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.56,0:07:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just call us Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.94,0:07:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.85,0:07:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only ask because your composition\Nisn't at all machine-like.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.14,0:07:25.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.90,0:07:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.38,0:07:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Patamon, can you really fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.02,0:07:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.30,0:07:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.66,0:07:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're going the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm faster than that. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.92,0:07:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be faster to walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.08,0:07:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon, I've been meaning\Nto ask, who does your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.88,0:07:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wake up in the morning like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, maybe you can let me work with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.76,0:07:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you put too\Nmuch emphasis on appearance?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, honestly, I never\Nreally thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.46,0:07:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I kind of like\Nmy hair the way it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.70,0:08:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I get back, this is\Ngoing to make one great story.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.00,0:08:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.16,0:08:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, of course, not a single\Nsoul will ever believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.82,0:08:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Kuwagamon back there, he was\Nhuge, and he's not the only one
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, nothing like the ocean! Ha ha,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.34,0:08:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everybody in the water Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.28,0:08:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's build a giant sandcastle\NOh, I forgot my bathing suit
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.02,0:08:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, listen, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.50,0:08:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A phone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.48,0:08:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either that or we're all hearing things
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.02,0:08:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you. All we needed\Nwas a phone. We're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.56,0:08:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd it stop ringing, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.24,0:08:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrong number
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.60,0:08:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.51,0:08:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's bizarre My theory is\Naliens They've set these phone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.38,0:08:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,booths out as a trap If we can\Nfind a place that delivers,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.04,0:09:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's order pizza Whatever you get,\Nno anchovies for me The question is,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.14,0:09:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what are these doing here at the beach?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.88,0:09:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So people can call their\Nparents for a ride home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.70,0:09:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.61,0:09:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly is a parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it. I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.50,0:09:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does anybody have any loose change? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.80,0:09:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously, I'm going to make\Na phone call to get some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.74,0:09:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, use my phone card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.42,0:09:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The aliens can bill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.78,0:09:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, maybe there's a\Nquarter in one of the slots.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm calling Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.70,0:09:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hooking up to the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.48,0:09:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm calling Colette.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Libs on Booth 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.16,0:09:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys. Wait for me. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.78,0:09:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.69,0:09:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.72,0:09:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the town, the time will\Nbe exactly 45 miles per hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.90,0:09:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And 90 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.86,0:09:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong or Mom's flipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.74,0:09:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's forecast calls for clear\Nskies with occasional ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.30,0:09:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you wear for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This number only exists\Nin your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.06,0:09:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please hang up and don't call back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.98,0:09:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What planet did I dial?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.90,0:10:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, it's\Na twisted alien joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.48,0:10:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try that one over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.24,0:10:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.24,0:10:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No telephones are working\Nin your service area.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.96,0:10:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang up and have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.36,0:10:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh. Any luck? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.82,0:10:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.73,0:10:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a strange feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.44,0:10:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe this one will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.94,0:10:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To leave a message, press one now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.08,0:10:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To leave a fingerprint, press two now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.98,0:10:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fifteen dollars for\Nthe next three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.64,0:10:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.58,0:10:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.70,0:10:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does Joe always behave like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.68,0:10:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what number or how many times he\Ndials, those phones aren't going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.34,0:11:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm going to keep searching\Nfor a boat or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.54,0:11:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.54,0:11:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though we can't call out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's always a chance someone\Nelse might be able to call into us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.94,0:11:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a waste of time doing\Nnothing but sitting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.66,0:11:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to stay here for a little\Nwhile and see if anyone calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.82,0:11:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, everyone could use a little rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm getting pretty\Nhungry, too. You know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.08,0:11:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because we haven't eaten anything all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, break time, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.34,0:11:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does anybody else have any food?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.22,0:11:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the only thing I have is... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that gadget that fell\Nout of the sky at camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.42,0:11:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot all about those weird gizmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.10,0:11:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anybody's got a pink one, I'll trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.06,0:11:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.24,0:11:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't have them if\Nthey weren't important.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.10,0:11:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I could take mine apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.12,0:11:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, that is, after I get something\Nto eat, I'm really famished.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.50,0:11:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the only thing I've\Ngot is my emergency supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.20,0:11:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got a first aid kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.86,0:12:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some bandages, and some medicine,\Nbut that's about all I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.06,0:12:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have my trusty laptop\Ncomputer and a digital camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.88,0:12:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and I've got a small cell phone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.18,0:12:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, not one of them's\Nworked since we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.86,0:12:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you dragged all\Nthat computer stuff to summer camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.26,0:12:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.40,0:12:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.70,0:12:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's my mini-telescope.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.66,0:12:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I don't have\Nanything to eat, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.02,0:12:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at what I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.32,0:12:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.23,0:12:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.82,0:12:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, look at all those goodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.30,0:12:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you be a good little boy and\Nshare those treats with dear sweet Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.66,0:12:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, you don't have to be so nice, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.70,0:12:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.76,0:12:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.67,0:12:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't she cute? Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.24,0:12:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry I could eat a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.20,0:12:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd settle for a small cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.04,0:12:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, what have you got in that big bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.16,0:12:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some hairbrushes and makeup?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.84,0:12:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's a compass,\Ncooking fuel, flashlight,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.02,0:12:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of those knives with all the\Nthings, and some other stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.20,0:12:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why didn't you tell us\Nyou had a compass back
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.32,0:13:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when we needed one i\Nthought it might be kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.14,0:13:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fun to see how far we\Ncould get without one
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.20,0:13:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,besides it's broken well\Nso much for finding our way
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.02,0:13:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out of here although we\Ncould use the cooking
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.60,0:13:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fuel to make a signal fire\Nthat's true or i guess
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.58,0:13:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we could barbecue some\Ntelephones oh boy check out
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.74,0:13:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the genius see he's trying\Nto call the telephone
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.32,0:13:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,repairman because the\Ntelephones don't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.76,0:13:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Problem is, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.32,0:13:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe's got the emergency food.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.46,0:13:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, hey Joe, look,\Nyou've got all the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.52,0:13:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't you know it's rude to interrupt\Nsomeone when they're on the telephone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.42,0:13:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that bag. This?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.44,0:13:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just brought it to give to Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.88,0:13:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today was her day to carry the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think he likes ya? No way. Mimi,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.22,0:13:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have got to stop\Nthinking of yourself and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.98,0:13:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do something to help\Nsomebody else for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.92,0:13:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a little responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.30,0:13:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that bag's too heavy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.56,0:13:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, you never hear me complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.36,0:13:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, guys, listen, the most important thing\Nnow is that we've got some food to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.28,0:13:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let's sit down and have some lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:13:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.00,0:14:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.70,0:14:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's seven people in\Nthe group times three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.42,0:14:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Times three meals, that comes to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.58,0:14:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,63 meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.64,0:14:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, so split evenly\Nbetween us, we have, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough food for three days. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.28,0:14:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, exactly, I guess you knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you guys, when you add in the Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.42,0:14:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we really only have enough\Nfor about half an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.00,0:14:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.96,0:14:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a problem at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.62,0:14:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We Digimon hunt and forage for ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.16,0:14:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.07,0:14:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to include us\Nin your calculations.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.52,0:14:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure, Biyomon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.88,0:14:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.28,0:14:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can do all right for ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.22,0:14:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.13,0:14:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now that that's taken care of,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's go ahead and divide this\Nbetween the seven people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.34,0:14:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.34,0:14:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could eat a dozen of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.38,0:14:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.52,0:14:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad we never hear you complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You people make me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:14:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what's the matter? Trouble. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.88,0:15:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.72,0:15:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shellmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.04,0:15:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a shellmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.26,0:15:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something that gets mad for no reason.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.47,0:15:47.47,Sign,Sign,0,180,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}SHELLMON
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.47,0:15:47.47,Sign,Sign,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.47,0:15:47.47,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Aquatic\N Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.47,0:15:47.47,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Type \NData
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.47,0:15:47.47,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Special Attack\N Hydro Pressure
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.60,0:15:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attacked by two digital\Nmonsters in the same day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.88,0:15:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And doesn't Shellmon know\NI'm allergic to shellfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.60,0:15:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody, up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.66,0:16:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tsunomon, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.12,0:16:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, you show him! Peppabread!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.60,0:16:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.32,0:16:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.26,0:16:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They look like they've lost their powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.04,0:16:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.62,0:16:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison Ivy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.64,0:16:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.98,0:16:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get him, Agumon! Why is\Nit only Agumon? We're just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.54,0:16:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too hungry what gabumon\Ni don't have any strength
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.52,0:16:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's it agumon is the\Nonly one who had anything
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.16,0:16:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to eat now i see then the\Nother digimon don't have
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.66,0:17:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enough strength left to\Nfight agumon looks like it's
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.06,0:17:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just you and me now then give me a\Ndiversion Hey, Shellmon! Ugly! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.42,0:17:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.08,0:17:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This'll work!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.40,0:17:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.62,0:17:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.64,0:17:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.80,0:17:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.36,0:17:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna get everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.30,0:17:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's nothing I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.84,0:17:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.94,0:17:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pidgey Falls!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.66,0:17:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.26,0:18:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.42,0:18:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pidgey Falls!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.68,0:18:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.16,0:18:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.84,0:18:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he did it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he's Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're getting him. Go, Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.58,0:19:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DigiNova Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.58,0:19:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.78,0:19:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon! Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.60,0:19:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You poor little guy, Agumon! Tai? Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.18,0:19:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have anything to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.20,0:19:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello! Come on, I know you're\Nthere! Operator? Operator!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.48,0:19:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's really no reason\Nto stay here now who
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.58,0:19:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wants to break the bad\Nnews to joe you want some
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.28,0:19:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more just think so Shellmon\Nwasn't destroyed he was
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.52,0:19:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just temporarily removed\Nwe should pack up and leave
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.20,0:19:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before he decides he wants\Nto come back for round
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.40,0:19:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,two good idea in that case\Nwe should go right back
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.14,0:20:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to the forest because if\Nanybody's looking for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.50,0:20:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's the place they'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.14,0:20:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, I said this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.58,0:20:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We fell off a cliff and floated\Ndown a river to get here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.28,0:20:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and getting back there's a really big job.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we could run into Kuwagamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.28,0:20:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen, logically speaking,\Nif there are telephones here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.02,0:20:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then there must be people to use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.14,0:20:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I think it makes good sense\Nto try and find those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.50,0:20:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.54,0:20:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It certainly does. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.52,0:20:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's all get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.78,0:20:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anywhere you want to go, I'll go, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.98,0:20:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just pick the direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.16,0:20:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's get out of this place\NAnd let the monsters beware
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.52,0:20:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, my plan is to avoid all monsters Yep,\Nthat's my plan Okay, here we go Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.10,0:21:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.52,0:21:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.43,0:22:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I close my eyes, I can't remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.70,0:22:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That day, that time, I can't see my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.98,0:22:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I see the wind, I can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.98,0:22:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.74,0:22:51.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.98,0:23:05.00,Sign,Sign,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}The Blue Wolf! Garurumon

